    {
      "line_id": "WR-E01-L001",
      "runtime_id": "afd1ed57",
      "speaker_id": "narrator",
      "text": "上一世，她簽了字，再也沒能走出這扇門。",
      "start_sample": 9600,
      "end_sample": 221280,
      "start_s": 0.2,
      "end_s": 4.61,
      "measured_voice_duration_s": 4.41,
      "audio_samples": 211680,
      "source_wav_sha256": "793d5da630cd48ae2c31af0d971421dfddc05b707b605a834d420c61856b373e",
      "source_wav_path": "/workspace/mokaair-work/competition-20261002/media/wedding-reckoning-e01-voice-zh-tw/audio/afd1ed57.wav",
      "trim_applied": false,
      "time_stretch": false
    },
    {
      "line_id": "WR-E01-L002",
      "runtime_id": "0c782990",
      "speaker_id": "chengchuan",
      "text": "字簽了，妳也就沒用了。",
      "start_sample": 249600,
      "end_sample": 388800,
      "start_s": 5.2,
      "end_s": 8.1,
      "measured_voice_duration_s": 2.9,
      "audio_samples": 139200,
      "source_wav_sha256": "10564cbafa86aebb8627a023fe5a21e2abc18e394759689fe60f172c7ebf55f2",
      "source_wav_path": "/workspace/mokaair-work/competition-20261002/media/wedding-reckoning-e01-voice-zh-tw/audio/0c782990.wav",
      "trim_applied": false,
      "time_stretch": false
    },
    {
      "line_id": "WR-E01-L003",
      "runtime_id": "0945b87f",
      "speaker_id": "narrator",
      "text": "再睜眼，她回到婚禮，還沒簽字。",
      "start_sample": 441600,
      "end_sample": 620160,
      "start_s": 9.2,
      "end_s": 12.92,
      "measured_voice_duration_s": 3.72,
      "audio_samples": 178560,
      "source_wav_sha256": "f8cf76dc040b3a312efca24edd24d308272bb571fccf16fe26e04e89e3963749",
      "source_wav_path": "/workspace/mokaair-work/competition-20261002/media/wedding-reckoning-e01-voice-zh-tw/audio/0945b87f.wav",
      "trim_applied": false,
      "time_stretch": false
    },
    {
      "line_id": "WR-E01-L004",
      "runtime_id": "c1ee7ed5",
      "speaker_id": "chengchuan",
      "text": "棠棠，簽了就好。",
      "start_sample": 652800,
      "end_sample": 736800,
      "start_s": 13.6,
      "end_s": 15.35,
      "measured_voice_duration_s": 1.75,
      "audio_samples": 84000,
      "source_wav_sha256": "4934ea1d9a0253e066273dd53c717a73aa4ef8b2dfa5c637d3d0b059d05bb3ae",
      "source_wav_path": "/workspace/mokaair-work/competition-20261002/media/wedding-reckoning-e01-voice-zh-tw/audio/c1ee7ed5.wav",
      "trim_applied": false,
      "time_stretch": false
    },
    {
      "line_id": "WR-E01-L005",
      "runtime_id": "677ac0bc",
      "speaker_id": "zhitang",
      "text": "這份授權，我不簽。",
      "start_sample": 777600,
      "end_sample": 874560,
      "start_s": 16.2,
      "end_s": 18.22,
      "measured_voice_duration_s": 2.02,
      "audio_samples": 96960,
      "source_wav_sha256": "aa3b95eeb84873718b2847078d773a76c640bdfe96a94df7273f3c35d2bc68bc",
      "source_wav_path": "/workspace/mokaair-work/competition-20261002/media/wedding-reckoning-e01-voice-zh-tw/audio/677ac0bc.wav",
      "trim_applied": false,
      "time_stretch": false
    },
    {
      "line_id": "WR-E01-L006",
      "runtime_id": "a390c745",
      "speaker_id": "zhitang",
      "text": "媽媽的公司，不拿來陪嫁。",
      "start_sample": 1156800,
      "end_sample": 1294080,
      "start_s": 24.1,
      "end_s": 26.96,
      "measured_voice_duration_s": 2.86,
      "audio_samples": 137280,
      "source_wav_sha256": "5033bae054b3f7c9b0ceed1c73b0f19932afe3f221fcd46647a3d002a420720a",
      "source_wav_path": "/workspace/mokaair-work/competition-20261002/media/wedding-reckoning-e01-voice-zh-tw/audio/a390c745.wav",
      "trim_applied": false,
      "time_stretch": false
    },
    {
      "line_id": "WR-E01-L007",
      "runtime_id": "6a480238",
      "speaker_id": "chengchuan",
      "text": "不簽，這婚就別結了。",
      "start_sample": 1353600,
      "end_sample": 1461600,
      "start_s": 28.2,
      "end_s": 30.45,
      "measured_voice_duration_s": 2.25,
      "audio_samples": 108000,
      "source_wav_sha256": "0976d56b31f0439e2279f3624a10271d84de56af8e022646c1a326e8eb5c3f94",
      "source_wav_path": "/workspace/mokaair-work/competition-20261002/media/wedding-reckoning-e01-voice-zh-tw/audio/6a480238.wav",
      "trim_applied": false,
      "time_stretch": false
    },
    {
      "line_id": "WR-E01-L008",
      "runtime_id": "548a5cb2",
      "speaker_id": "zhitang",
      "text": "那婚禮就到這裡。",
      "start_sample": 1521600,
      "end_sample": 1618560,
      "start_s": 31.7,
      "end_s": 33.72,
      "measured_voice_duration_s": 2.02,
      "audio_samples": 96960,
      "source_wav_sha256": "b769a1919bc311a9186e6ec0591b37e6abcd98b64114204d21e1ee3621933192",
      "source_wav_path": "/workspace/mokaair-work/competition-20261002/media/wedding-reckoning-e01-voice-zh-tw/audio/548a5cb2.wav",
      "trim_applied": false,
      "time_stretch": false
    },
    {
      "line_id": "WR-E01-L009",
      "runtime_id": "087d01cb",
      "speaker_id": "zhitang",
      "text": "撕掉的，只是展示副本。",
      "start_sample": 1929600,
      "end_sample": 2054880,
      "start_s": 40.2,
      "end_s": 42.81,
      "measured_voice_duration_s": 2.61,
      "audio_samples": 125280,
      "source_wav_sha256": "f179b807ce3c403ed029983063876a104a4c62fd2d187c3a71bd3f3683f2fb72",
      "source_wav_path": "/workspace/mokaair-work/competition-20261002/media/wedding-reckoning-e01-voice-zh-tw/audio/087d01cb.wav",
      "trim_applied": false,
      "time_stretch": false
    },
    {
      "line_id": "WR-E01-L010",
      "runtime_id": "b9acfedc",
      "speaker_id": "zhitang",
      "text": "原件留在這裡。",
      "start_sample": 2092800,
      "end_sample": 2171040,
      "start_s": 43.6,
      "end_s": 45.23,
      "measured_voice_duration_s": 1.63,
      "audio_samples": 78240,
      "source_wav_sha256": "7e373d2a3e74e1717205982a8883491f19f0422b271a72e5419dd5930992a57f",
      "source_wav_path": "/workspace/mokaair-work/competition-20261002/media/wedding-reckoning-e01-voice-zh-tw/audio/b9acfedc.wav",
      "trim_applied": false,
      "time_stretch": false
    },
    {
      "line_id": "WR-E01-L011",
      "runtime_id": "e24854f2",
      "speaker_id": "zhitang",
      "text": "表決權，我不交。",
      "start_sample": 2183040,
      "end_sample": 2270880,
      "start_s": 45.48,
      "end_s": 47.31,
      "measured_voice_duration_s": 1.83,
      "audio_samples": 87840,
      "source_wav_sha256": "a48bedabe1f959d26b2f3c7c5fd2fe3628989a18e6b3a58d46ea31c14dbdeff8",
      "source_wav_path": "/workspace/mokaair-work/competition-20261002/media/wedding-reckoning-e01-voice-zh-tw/audio/e24854f2.wav",
      "trim_applied": false,
      "time_stretch": false
    },
    {
      "line_id": "WR-E01-L012",
      "runtime_id": "697ed8c3",
      "speaker_id": "chengchuan",
      "text": "這麼多人看著，妳非要現在讓我難堪？",
      "start_sample": 2457600,
      "end_sample": 2631840,
      "start_s": 51.2,
      "end_s": 54.83,
      "measured_voice_duration_s": 3.63,
      "audio_samples": 174240,
      "source_wav_sha256": "14e67fc3c103826f5fe720a7c1e5f63853baf5936bbe174b27a82df1d8c58008",
      "source_wav_path": "/workspace/mokaair-work/competition-20261002/media/wedding-reckoning-e01-voice-zh-tw/audio/697ed8c3.wav",
      "trim_applied": false,
      "time_stretch": false
    },
    {
      "line_id": "WR-E01-L013",
      "runtime_id": "2f1c26d4",
      "speaker_id": "zhitang",
      "text": "你剛才說，不簽就別結。我聽清楚了。",
      "start_sample": 2655840,
      "end_sample": 2863200,
      "start_s": 55.33,
      "end_s": 59.65,
      "measured_voice_duration_s": 4.32,
      "audio_samples": 207360,
      "source_wav_sha256": "2289b164f25eb025512f9d93ed8a1c821ac8c2455fa4f1c5a26c69b1f811ce42",
      "source_wav_path": "/workspace/mokaair-work/competition-20261002/media/wedding-reckoning-e01-voice-zh-tw/audio/2f1c26d4.wav",
      "trim_applied": false,
      "time_stretch": false
    },
    {
      "line_id": "WR-E01-L014",
      "runtime_id": "c9db2b4d",
      "speaker_id": "chengchuan",
      "text": "棠棠，剩下的事，我們回去再說。",
      "start_sample": 2887200,
      "end_sample": 3040800,
      "start_s": 60.15,
      "end_s": 63.35,
      "measured_voice_duration_s": 3.2,
      "audio_samples": 153600,
      "source_wav_sha256": "4a141c995db83b4da514d2f3736a85bb055890814323bea965259e07fba45646",
      "source_wav_path": "/workspace/mokaair-work/competition-20261002/media/wedding-reckoning-e01-voice-zh-tw/audio/c9db2b4d.wav",
      "trim_applied": false,
      "time_stretch": false
    },
    {
      "line_id": "WR-E01-L015",
      "runtime_id": "87fb4d12",
      "speaker_id": "zhitang",
      "text": "就在這裡。先讓我把頁碼拍下來。",
      "start_sample": 3064800,
      "end_sample": 3199200,
      "start_s": 63.85,
      "end_s": 66.65,
      "measured_voice_duration_s": 2.8,
      "audio_samples": 134400,
      "source_wav_sha256": "f28b2f3de3f441f0f313d4a26dea998e0084c99e5dc31cc1e339e7989d70a676",
      "source_wav_path": "/workspace/mokaair-work/competition-20261002/media/wedding-reckoning-e01-voice-zh-tw/audio/87fb4d12.wav",
      "trim_applied": false,
      "time_stretch": false
    },
    {
      "line_id": "WR-E01-L016",
      "runtime_id": "7410ddec",
      "speaker_id": "chengchuan",
      "text": "妳還怕我把文件換了？",
      "start_sample": 3367200,
      "end_sample": 3501120,
      "start_s": 70.15,
      "end_s": 72.94,
      "measured_voice_duration_s": 2.79,
      "audio_samples": 133920,
      "source_wav_sha256": "f62e02f210d5304e025a8aab620a9ea55afdec99327df6c9a6e2a109c5710c01",
      "source_wav_path": "/workspace/mokaair-work/competition-20261002/media/wedding-reckoning-e01-voice-zh-tw/audio/7410ddec.wav",
      "trim_applied": false,
      "time_stretch": false
    },
    {
      "line_id": "WR-E01-L017",
      "runtime_id": "105882b7",
      "speaker_id": "zhitang",
      "text": "我只要今天擺在這張桌上的這一份。",
      "start_sample": 3525120,
      "end_sample": 3744960,
      "start_s": 73.44,
      "end_s": 78.02,
      "measured_voice_duration_s": 4.58,
      "audio_samples": 219840,
      "source_wav_sha256": "f1667604195aecfe14c9f2ab4dd364ece3f228e3a5a2f2186c5250ac9168c556",
      "source_wav_path": "/workspace/mokaair-work/competition-20261002/media/wedding-reckoning-e01-voice-zh-tw/audio/105882b7.wav",
      "trim_applied": false,
      "time_stretch": false
    },
    {
      "line_id": "WR-E01-L018",
      "runtime_id": "f7f86c90",
      "speaker_id": "zhitang",
      "text": "請照原件，另留一份完整副本給我。附件也要。",
      "start_sample": 3768960,
      "end_sample": 4040640,
      "start_s": 78.52,
      "end_s": 84.18,
      "measured_voice_duration_s": 5.66,
      "audio_samples": 271680,
      "source_wav_sha256": "188dc14cbdb5be58035bb0928a4935ce168248cb28887377b08cd30b291d0200",
      "source_wav_path": "/workspace/mokaair-work/competition-20261002/media/wedding-reckoning-e01-voice-zh-tw/audio/f7f86c90.wav",
      "trim_applied": false,
      "time_stretch": false
    },
    {
      "line_id": "WR-E01-L019",
      "runtime_id": "824e2f7a",
      "speaker_id": "chengchuan",
      "text": "婚禮都停了，妳還要留這些做什麼？",
      "start_sample": 4064640,
      "end_sample": 4257120,
      "start_s": 84.68,
      "end_s": 88.69,
      "measured_voice_duration_s": 4.01,
      "audio_samples": 192480,
      "source_wav_sha256": "8d4fc898ceeb6a4e5518cb45f380790eb05034e96601950856f94dfa29c21cf2",
      "source_wav_path": "/workspace/mokaair-work/competition-20261002/media/wedding-reckoning-e01-voice-zh-tw/audio/824e2f7a.wav",
      "trim_applied": false,
      "time_stretch": false
    },
    {
      "line_id": "WR-E01-L020",
      "runtime_id": "a645c999",
      "speaker_id": "zhitang",
      "text": "你要我簽的東西，我總該留著看清楚。",
      "start_sample": 4281120,
      "end_sample": 4489920,
      "start_s": 89.19,
      "end_s": 93.54,
      "measured_voice_duration_s": 4.35,
      "audio_samples": 208800,
      "source_wav_sha256": "b2c36d8f6ca7442a08a147fabac82cb30f3a0cf91988f92b91557610aeb59721",
      "source_wav_path": "/workspace/mokaair-work/competition-20261002/media/wedding-reckoning-e01-voice-zh-tw/audio/a645c999.wav",
      "trim_applied": false,
      "time_stretch": false
    },
    {
      "line_id": "WR-E01-L021",
      "runtime_id": "0d053763",
      "speaker_id": "zhitang",
      "text": "頁碼對得上。這份我收著。",
      "start_sample": 4801920,
      "end_sample": 4960800,
      "start_s": 100.04,
      "end_s": 103.35,
      "measured_voice_duration_s": 3.31,
      "audio_samples": 158880,
      "source_wav_sha256": "0ff5635ca01ead375396863f9188a6f6c4b2dafb79a840be709adad213738537",
      "source_wav_path": "/workspace/mokaair-work/competition-20261002/media/wedding-reckoning-e01-voice-zh-tw/audio/0d053763.wav",
      "trim_applied": false,
      "time_stretch": false
    },
    {
      "line_id": "WR-E01-L022",
      "runtime_id": "aa839f9a",
      "speaker_id": "zhixia",
      "text": "姐。",
      "start_sample": 5128800,
      "end_sample": 5144160,
      "start_s": 106.85,
      "end_s": 107.17,
      "measured_voice_duration_s": 0.32,
      "audio_samples": 15360,
      "source_wav_sha256": "50e5803f96ccd1d9bb62cff3b9bc426f3eb9fb04edebfdea0e2c2f65c1688b1e",
      "source_wav_path": "/workspace/mokaair-work/competition-20261002/media/wedding-reckoning-e01-voice-zh-tw/audio/aa839f9a.wav",
      "trim_applied": false,
      "time_stretch": false
    },
    {
      "line_id": "WR-E01-L023",
      "runtime_id": "f60cc415",
      "speaker_id": "zhixia",
      "text": "這個，我本來想今天給妳。",
      "start_sample": 5224800,
      "end_sample": 5357760,
      "start_s": 108.85,
      "end_s": 111.62,
      "measured_voice_duration_s": 2.77,
      "audio_samples": 132960,
      "source_wav_sha256": "c6732c07199e3a5080542118337d3e865ff297fcc76bd8ed121c970aef2f92c3",
      "source_wav_path": "/workspace/mokaair-work/competition-20261002/media/wedding-reckoning-e01-voice-zh-tw/audio/f60cc415.wav",
      "trim_applied": false,
      "time_stretch": false
    },
    {
      "line_id": "WR-E01-L024",
      "runtime_id": "f78ef77f",
      "speaker_id": "zhitang",
      "text": "先別給我。",
      "start_sample": 5381760,
      "end_sample": 5432640,
      "start_s": 112.12,
      "end_s": 113.18,
      "measured_voice_duration_s": 1.06,
      "audio_samples": 50880,
      "source_wav_sha256": "119de78732b7b56cf88661febde9d3b881b9c794086d7eac02797d778de0539c",
      "source_wav_path": "/workspace/mokaair-work/competition-20261002/media/wedding-reckoning-e01-voice-zh-tw/audio/f78ef77f.wav",
      "trim_applied": false,
      "time_stretch": false
    },
    {
      "line_id": "WR-E01-L025",
      "runtime_id": "b4fa3234",
      "speaker_id": "zhixia",
      "text": "好，我先留著。",
      "start_sample": 5477760,
      "end_sample": 5553600,
      "start_s": 114.12,
      "end_s": 115.7,
      "measured_voice_duration_s": 1.58,
      "audio_samples": 75840,
      "source_wav_sha256": "7c40fab127ff13ffce6984626eda27632e5a65ddc9e431d14773b19c94414bd0",
      "source_wav_path": "/workspace/mokaair-work/competition-20261002/media/wedding-reckoning-e01-voice-zh-tw/audio/b4fa3234.wav",
      "trim_applied": false,
      "time_stretch": false
    },
    {
      "line_id": "WR-E01-L026",
      "runtime_id": "8704bfd6",
      "speaker_id": "chengchuan",
      "text": "棠棠，妳連我也信不過？",
      "start_sample": 5577600,
      "end_sample": 5706720,
      "start_s": 116.2,
      "end_s": 118.89,
      "measured_voice_duration_s": 2.69,
      "audio_samples": 129120,
      "source_wav_sha256": "f70b972d242fb6aa4cb5ef20f10e4a73520ebb6b1fabe2218b4b568567e0f121",
      "source_wav_path": "/workspace/mokaair-work/competition-20261002/media/wedding-reckoning-e01-voice-zh-tw/audio/8704bfd6.wav",
      "trim_applied": false,
      "time_stretch": false
    },
    {
      "line_id": "WR-E01-L027",
      "runtime_id": "dfa350c2",
      "speaker_id": "zhitang",
      "text": "我信過。所以這次，我要自己看。",
      "start_sample": 5718720,
      "end_sample": 5902080,
      "start_s": 119.14,
      "end_s": 122.96,
